Subject: [local-runtime] repoint Curobo asset paths to canonical RoboTwin

This patch records the mechanical runtime-only repair applied to the ignored
`external/RoboTwin` checkout on Jingxiang. All twelve occurrences of
`/home/jingxiang/gujie/RoboTwin` in these six YAML files were replaced with
`/home/jingxiang/workspace/robot-harness-gen-env/external/RoboTwin`:

- assets/embodiments/ARX-X5/curobo.yml
- assets/embodiments/aloha-agilex/curobo_left.yml
- assets/embodiments/aloha-agilex/curobo_right.yml
- assets/embodiments/franka-panda/curobo.yml
- assets/embodiments/piper/curobo.yml
- assets/embodiments/ur5-wsg/curobo.yml

The changed fields are each embodiment's `urdf_path` and `collision_spheres`.
The repair is deliberately recorded as local runtime provenance because the
bulk RoboTwin checkout is excluded from this repository.
